OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: Duck released after
OL,4,Arecovering from injury
OL,5,
OL,6,FA duck whose beak was left hanging at a
OL,7,Fright angle after an injury has made a
OL,8,Ffull recovery and been released back
OL,9,Finto the wild.
OL,11,FThe bird was found in Fordingbridge in
OL,12,FJune and treated by Wildlife Rescue -
OL,13,FMoyles Court, near Ringwood, after
OL,14,Fbeing caught by a member of the public.
OL,16,FThe charity said the duck's treatment
OL,17,Finvolved several surgeries and
OL,18,Fcontinued nursing care.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
