OL,3,GNEWSAWatch: Duck released after
OL,4,Arecovering from injury
OL,5,
OL,6,FSharing footage of the duck's release,
OL,7,Fthe charity said it was "more than
OL,8,Fpleased" to confirm the bird had made a
OL,9,Ffull recovery, crediting the "skill and
OL,10,Fdedication" of its team.
